    "description": "## 80 automated `pm.test` checks\\nCovers **status codes**, **error JSON**, **headers**, **timing**, and **happy-path shapes** for real `src/app/api/*` routes.\\n\\n### Variables\\n- `baseUrl` — http://localhost:3000\\n- `agencyId`, `subAccountId`, `templateId` — UUIDs / ids from your env\\n- `funnelToolsSecret` — must match **FUNNEL_TOOLS_SECRET** when that env is set; leave empty if unset\\n\\n### Newman\\n```\\nnewman run postman/pixora-api-unit-tests.postman_collection.json --env-var baseUrl=http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n**Note:** True **unit tests** for pure functions live in `bun test tests/unit`. This collection is **API contract / integration** testing via Postman.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
